    # "白一语气抬高，像是听到了什么令人很惊讶的事情。"
    "Bai Yi's tone rose, as if she had heard something very surprising."

# game/scripts/c1/c1-2.rpy:549
translate english ch1_2_1834d120_6:

    # me "……"
    me "..."

